title: "Batas: what does the Philippine Congress actually pass?"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Africa
    given-names: David Demitri
date-released: 2026-09-30
license: ODbL-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/DavidDemitriAfrica/batas"
url: "https://daviddemitriafrica.github.io/batas/"
abstract: >
  Every Philippine Republic Act from 1946 to 2026, classified by what it does,
  placed on a map, linked to the House bills and authors behind it, and checked
  against DepEd's school lists and PhilHealth's hospital list.
keywords:
  - Philippines
  - Congress
  - legislation
  - Republic Acts
  - local bills
  - political dynasties
